WEBVTT

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:33.714
we know that exposure to violence
can lead to more violence.

00:01:34.215 --> 00:01:36.884
Research has shown
that survivors of violence

00:01:36.926 --> 00:01:39.053
can be up to six times more likely

00:01:39.095 --> 00:01:42.431
to either be involved in violence
or be revictimized.

00:01:43.641 --> 00:01:46.686
It's literally the definition
of a vicious cycle.

00:01:48.521 --> 00:01:52.358
The good news is we know
that we can interrupt this cycle

00:01:52.358 --> 00:01:57.196
by addressing the underlying trauma
with better access to mental health care.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.448
The only problem is

00:01:59.448 --> 00:02:01.826
access to mental health care
in these communities